sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant ISVCCtrl as InferenceService<br/>Controller
    participant GWCtrl as Gateway<br/>Controller
    participant SRCtrl as ServingRuntime<br/>Controller
    participant ServingAPI as model-serving-api<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User, SRCtrl: InferenceService Lifecycle Flow
        User->>K8sAPI: POST InferenceService CR
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission Review<br/>TLS, service-ca cert
        Webhook->>Webhook: Mutate (inject defaults)
        Webhook->>Webhook: Validate (schema/policy)
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse (allow/deny)
        K8sAPI-->>User: CR Created

        K8sAPI->>ISVCCtrl: Watch event: InferenceService
        ISVCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Service<br/>ServiceAccount token
        ISVCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Route<br/>ServiceAccount token
        ISVCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>ServiceAccount token
        ISVCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ClusterRoleBinding<br/>ServiceAccount token
        ISVCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor<br/>ServiceAccount token
        ISVCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create TriggerAuthentication<br/>ServiceAccount token

        K8sAPI->>SRCtrl: Watch event: ServingRuntime
        SRCtrl->>K8sAPI: Ensure ServingRuntime template<br/>ServiceAccount token

        K8sAPI->>GWCtrl: Watch event: Gateway/LLMInferenceService
        GWCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>ServiceAccount token
        GWCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create EnvoyFilter<br/>ServiceAccount token
        GWCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create AuthPolicy (Kuadrant)<br/>ServiceAccount token
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over User, ServingAPI: Model-Serving API Flow
        User->>ServingAPI: GET /api/v1/gateways<br/>Authorization: Bearer token
        ServingAPI->>ServingAPI: Auth middleware validates token
        ServingAPI->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>Forwarded Bearer token
        K8sAPI-->>ServingAPI: Access granted
        ServingAPI->>K8sAPI: List Gateways<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>ServingAPI: Gateway list
        ServingAPI-->>User: JSON response (TLS)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over User, ServingAPI: Samples API Flow (Unauthenticated)
        User->>ServingAPI: GET /api/v1/samples/llm-d
        ServingAPI-->>User: Static YAML templates (TLS)
    end

    rect rgb(248, 240, 255)
        Note over ISVCCtrl, OTel: Observability Flow
        ISVCCtrl->>OTel: OTLP/gRPC traces<br/>TLS enabled
        ServingAPI->>OTel: OTLP/gRPC traces<br/>TLS enabled
        Note over ISVCCtrl: Metrics: :8443/metrics<br/>TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
        Note over ServingAPI: Metrics: :8080/metrics<br/>TLS only, no app auth
    end
